+# Final seam review, epic hg-blw, integration branch super-auto/graph-state-inspection
+
+Invocation inv-4b650ab2-a313-4bcb-9196-17e40854f3ab. Source: base bfeb8f3104dd3783d67a46570c9f272e935012b5, head 6eb6cec786cde8ca070fbf9aed46bb0609ff63ac. Both were verified with `git rev-parse --verify <sha>^{commit}`. bind-review-source exited 0 before this file was written.
+
+The caller checkout was observed at HEAD 6eb6cec with a clean `git status --short`, before and after the review. It was not switched, restored or edited. No tests were run and no rigs were started. Every cluster reviewer reported that the hg-build toolbox fails with "unable to find user alepar".
